  <paragraph>Remember that like terms must have the same variables with the same exponents.</paragraph>
  <example number="6.5">
    <problem>
      <paragraph>Simplify: $$c^{2} + 7d^{2} - 6c^{2}$$ .</paragraph>
    </problem>
    <solution>
