  <heading level="2">Evaluate a Polynomial for a Given Value</heading>
  <paragraph>We have already learned how to evaluate expressions. Since polynomials are expressions, we’ll follow the same procedures to evaluate a polynomial. We will substitute the given value for the variable and then simplify using the order of operations.</paragraph>
